## Interface: 11200
## Title: LibConfig-1.0
## Notes: Vanilla (1.12.1) options-window library. Renders an AceConfig-format options table into its own window, replacing the broken Blizzard Interface Options frame on Unreal Azeroth. Embedded minor (LibStub), loaded by host addons via LibConfig-1.0.xml.
## Version: 1.0

